      "description": "Get complete information and cool facts about American Revolution history and Revolutionary War. You can study about key terms, events, people, battles and weapons of the American Revolution. Test and improve your American Revolutionary knowledge answering the many engaging questions with our quiz application. \nOur educational app also helpful for high school and graduate school students and teachers.\n\nYou can learn about at the following American Revolution topics:\n- Overview of the American Revolution\n- The Revolutionary War(1775–1783)\n- The Declaration of Independence(1776)\n- The Revolution Begins(1772–1775)\n- The Boston Massacre and Tea Party\n- The French and Indian War(1754–1763)\n- Key Terms of The American Revolution\n- Key People of The American Revolution\n- Key Events of The American Revolution\n\nAPP FEATURES:\n- You can play this app everywhere. Internet connection is NOT needed.\n- There are 2 quiz mode. Multiple Choice Quiz and True/False Quiz.\n- You can show correct answer if you get answer wrong.\n- Monitor your score and achievement while playing quiz.\n- Review and check questions on quiz history.\n- View your detailed quiz statistics by quiz mode. \n- Simple and effective interfaces.",
